  lol: "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u043E\u043A"
  TutorTranslates:
  - Id: 0
    Phrase: Hi! Let me show you how things work here.
  - Id: 1
    Phrase: "You\u2019ve got some starting cash. The main way to earn is by multiplying
      your bet."
  - Id: 2
    Phrase: "Let\u2019s place your money. The longer you stay in this zone, the higher
      your bet grows."
  - Id: 3
    Phrase: "Let\u2019s double your winnings. But remember - the higher the multiplier,
      the farther you\u2019ll have to go."
  - Id: 4
    Phrase: Time to fly! Run to the start zone.
  - Id: 5
    Phrase: To make it to the end, grab boosts and dodge traps.
  - Id: 6
    Phrase: Your goal is the cruiser. Good luck!
  - Id: 7
    Phrase: Nice job! Congratulations on your win! Head back to spawn.
  - Id: 8
    Phrase: "Let\u2019s collect your reward for completing the missions."
  - Id: 9
    Phrase: "You can upgrade your character. Let\u2019s boost your distance reward."
  - Id: 10
    Phrase: You can also earn money in mini-games. Good luck out there!
